### 新增文档
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java 学习笔记",
  "fileType": "PDF"
}

### 查询文档列表（分页；默认 page=0、size=10）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents

### 指定分页参数
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents?page=0&size=5

### 下一页
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents?page=1&size=5

### 非法 page → 期待 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents?page=-1

### 非法 size → 期待 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents?size=0

### 非法 size → 期待 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents?size=101
### 查询单条文档
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents/1


### 修改文档
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/documents/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新后的 Java 学习笔记",
  "fileType": "PDF"
}


### 删除文档
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/documents/1

### ===== Day 10 异常场景验证 =====

### 标题为空 → 期待 400 {"status":400,"error":"Bad Request","message":"文档标题不能为空",...}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "fileType": "PDF"
}

### 非法 JSON → 期待 400 {"status":400,"message":"请求体格式错误：请检查 JSON 语法和字段类型",...}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title":

### 查询不存在的文档 → 期待 404 {"status":404,"error":"Not Found","message":"文档不存在：id=99999",...}
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents/99999

### 路径参数不是数字 → 期待 400 {"status":400,"message":"参数 id 格式错误，应为 Long",...}
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents/abc

### 不带 JSON 头的新增 → 期待 415 {"status":415,"message":"Content-Type 不支持，请使用 application/json",...}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents

{
  "title": "无 Content-Type 的请求",
  "fileType": "PDF"
}

### 对单条文档发 POST（方法不允许）→ 期待 405
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents/1

### 不存在的接口路径 → 期待 404 {"status":404,"message":"请求的接口不存在",...}
GET http://localhost:8080/api/no-such-api
